{
  "id": 120520547,
  "iid": 4530,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Added Allied Telesis Loop Detection Frames",
  "description": "This is a request to contribute my work on Allied Telesis' Loop Detection Frames.\nThe data structure was not guessed or reverse-engineered, it has been officially checked with vendor's dev team.\n\nThe frames are LLC frames with `DSAP=0`, `SSAP=0`, `Control=0xE3`. Because these type of LLC frames have simply displayed the raw data by `call_data_dissector()`, I've extended `packet-llc.c` with a new `other_control_dissector_table` dissector table.\n\nHopefully, I've fulfilled all contribution rules because I'm a first-time contributor. If my proposal or changes to `packet-llc.c` are not acceptable, I appreciate any help and guidance.\n\nMartin",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-10-08T18:09:45.893Z",
